Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When that bubble first appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I couldn't see Yugi,\NI could still somehow sense him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.45,0:01:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But now... I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we've been cut off from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe, maybe he's been cut off from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That Bakudan detonator Pegasus set is\Ndue to go off in just two more turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But with Yugi gone from this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He can no longer help me keep\NPegasus from reading minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.99,0:01:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is still with you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe me, his heart\Nis still in this. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but how can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.57,0:01:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought only what\Nyour eyes showed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The unshakable devotion of Yugi's\Nfriends keeps his spirit alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His friends? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:02:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't given up on him. There's got
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to be something we can\Ndo we can't lose him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got an idea.\NYugi reached out to us, so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to try reaching\Nout to him in the same way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,remember the friendship pact we\Nmade yeah I sure do we said we'd
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,always be there for each other\Nright well if we concentrate our
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,energies and try to reach him\Nwith all our might Then maybe our
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,bond of friendship could get through\Nto him even in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Think hard. We can do this. I know we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us are here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuge, we believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though we might not be able\Nto see just what's going on in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll help you stop Pegasus' cheating\Nand get you back here safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.61,0:03:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, trying to conceal your card, eh? Fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing you can hide from me since\Nyou lost your mind-shuffling partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Impossible! Inconceivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's being blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Powers\Nare totally unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to scan your\Nevery thought and strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to see each\Nand every card in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so long as we're here\Nhelping our buddy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of his mind and stay out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we can stand strong against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, you just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your eye makes\Nall the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're wrong. Friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:04:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to them, I can save my magician\Nfrom the blast of your Bakudan detonator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My detonator will win this duel for me\Ndespite your pathetic little friends. Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now that these friends are\Nworking with me on a whole new level,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a whole new game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare yourself, Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,because with Yugi's friends preventing\Nyou from seeing the cards I pulled,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll just have to\Ntake them as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And for this turn, they don't\Ncome any better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.91,0:04:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Mystic Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystic Box?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have countered that if I\Nhad been able to see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic of the mystic\Nbox frees my magician
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and puts your Bakudan\Ndetonator in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, now its blast will\Nonly destroy Relinquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.19,0:05:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Brain control!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Relinquished will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Brainwashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Under my control for one whole turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel, Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to have the tables turned and the magical\Npowers of mind control used against you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take Relinquished, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That detonator you attached to\Nhim is set to go off this turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll blast your magician\Nand deplete your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Pegasus. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I still have one more card out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The card that took the last\Nbit of Yugi's courage to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time to find out what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ritual card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic ritual!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And to invoke its great powers,\NI must make a double offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So I offer your Jigen Bakudan\Nand the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakudan's been sacrificed\Nbefore it could detonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But what has he created in its place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The offering has been accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A new power is brought forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Pegasus! Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magician of Black Chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have succeeded in\Nputting Yugi out of commission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but not before his final\Ncourageous act set the stage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,for the greatest magician\Nin all of Duel Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the Magician of Black Chaos,\NI will avenge my fallen friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Pegasus, you're through. No card\Nin your deck can save you now, Yugi's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,last act of courage will finish you\Nas powerful as that creature may be it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,matters not for in one turn that brain\Ncontrol card will expire and i will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,regain command over relinquished the power\Nto absorb and assimilate monsters will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,be mine again and with it i'll steal\Nthat magician of black chaos and his
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,powers instead of being this fool's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,deliverance he'll be his undoing you know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're right about that chaos\Nmage I think he will bring about the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:08:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,end of this match and a lot sooner than\Nyou may think we'll see we will Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, to complete my strategy, I play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And also one monster\Ncard in defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows that when relinquished\Nhis back under my control,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have the power to\Nassimilate his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Those cards he threw must be part\Nof a strategy to try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the effects of your turn are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,your brain control spell has expired and\Nrelinquished his back where he belongs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,with his daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And even with your two mystery\Ncards out on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find that he's\Njust as effective as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That is after I make a\Nsmall addition to him and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,create the most sinister\Nbeast my deck can produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll crush this fool and make him\Nregret ever trifling with my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you have relinquished\Nall figured out, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm using my polymerization card\Nto fuse him with Thousand Eyes Idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself for\Nthe ultimate merged monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Thousand Eyes idle and\Nrelinquished fused together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've created the one, the only,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the Thousand Eyes Restrict.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quite a looker, eh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think he's a real stunner now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,well, just wait until all\N1,000 of his eyes open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I think you'll find that he's\Nmuch more than just a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stay strong for Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not letting up, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not till he's home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're with you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't give up on you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we believe in you\Nlike we always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in you with all our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is truly in\Nsight, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with my Chaos Mage protecting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think you'll find that once all\Neyes are on your Magician of Black Chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,he won't even be able to protect himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, trust me, you'll see\Nwhat I mean very shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon every eyeball on my Thousand\NEyes Restrict will open up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the monsters Yugi has\Non the field will be paralyzed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:11:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to attack or defend\NThen nothing will stop me from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Assimilating that Chaos Mage and\Nwinning this duel once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not know what Pegasus\Nis planning to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that monstrosity of his\NBut whatever it may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let it happen Not after\Nthe tremendous act of bravery
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi made to give us a fighting\Nchance against Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We both have to trust in\Nthe heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This next card that I\Npull might be my last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, make it one\Nthat can defeat Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi risked everything\Nto give me this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let his last\Nheroic effort be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, you can do your worst,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But this duel will be won by the card\NYugi picked in his final act of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.51,0:11:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand Eyes Restrict.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to open your peepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaos Mage, prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to hold him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing you can\Ndo to hold this attack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I unleash the\NThousand Eyes Spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My Chaos Mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is trapped by the mystic gaze of\Nmy ultimate beast. And don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you can rescue him There's no\Nescape from the mesmerizing eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose gaze blankets your field.\NEven the monsters you've hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,From me, have become paralyzed. You\Nhaven't won yet. Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a matter of moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,my Thousand Eyes Restrict will\Nassimilate your Chaos Mage,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.53,0:12:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,absorb his magical powers, and finish\Nyou off with one thunderous blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Except it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's last card has failed you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His Millennium Puzzle will soon be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.19,0:13:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaos Mage, come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorption Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the play I was waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In mere moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,your magician of Black Chaos will be\Nassimilated and all his powers will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right about\Nyour Thousand Eyes spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It did affect all my hidden\Nmonsters, specifically my Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And it paralyzed him\Nalong with my Chaos Mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I activated my other\Ndown card, Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One Karibo is becoming many.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Those disgusting fuzzballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're spreading like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and because it's too late to call back the\Nabsorption force spell that you just cast
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,your thousand eyes restrict has no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but to assimilate them all if it can no
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,those furry freaks have covered him from
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,head to toe there must\Nbe a thousand of them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tens of thousands,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus! And because of\Nthe way the Karibos attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to see just\Nas many explosions. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibos self-destructs on\Ncontact with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Yugi Moto!\NYou and your Karibos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Karibo was my monster,\Nso I do lose 300 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, that's a small price to\Npay for crippling that giant eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My thousand eyes restrict.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that your monster's transfixing\Ngaze has been broken, my Chaos Mage is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Pegasus, are through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With Chaos Scepter Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Thousand Eyes Restrict\Nhas been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.47,0:15:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you guys feel what I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Like he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I feel it\Ntoo. I think he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, you're finished.\NWe've won. No, how can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's, it's impossible. My eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,my magic It all failed me Cecilia,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,my love I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of the puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank\Nyou It was your courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and the love your friends had for you that\Nprevailed this day And your determination
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We all did it, together
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, as friends. And in the\Nend, that's what it came down to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends being there for one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I think I can\Nsee something. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, Yugi, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You really...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What Joey is trying to\Nsay is that it's really
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,great you and your grandpa\Nare going to be reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.81,0:17:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But also you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we wanted to say how impressed we\Nare with you for being so brave and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, impressed. And we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're proud of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are stealing\Neverything I was gonna say!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So then talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi won! Hey! Go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:17:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We all won.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, let's not forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over until Pegasus releases\Neveryone's souls, just like he promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Tay is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So then let's go grab the creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I not surprised by this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Slippery double-crossing snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't just leave Mokuba\Nand Bakura here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I not been normal, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He must not be able to remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that weird ring you wear around your neck
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,was making you act like\Na real freak again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Freak? Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His Millennium Ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it now? Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I chucked that thing\Nas far away as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was making me act weird,\Nthen I guess it was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But it appears I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're okay, could\Nyou watch Mokuba for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go and find that creep Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, he made a promise to\NFrito's souls, and he's gonna keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If Pegasus restores Mokuba's soul,\Nhis body will be useless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.61,0:19:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But it matters not, because now that\NPegasus is weakened by his duel with Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,he's given me the opportunity\NI've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.39,0:19:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come for me to add\NPegasus' Millennium Item to my collection.
